  <ym-title|HumanizeYM_v2><label|humanizeym_v2>

  HumanizeYM_v2 is a 306-page, AI-assisted working manuscript, submitted for
  discussion by Trishen Gunaratnam. It gives a conditional construction from
  Wilson's lattice model and documents several checked local repairs. Its
  main construction still depends on the estimates listed in the opening
  proof-status section and at their uses in the proof. See <hlink|Proof
  status|PROOF-STATUS.tm>.

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item><hlink|Manuscript PDF|https://github.com/scottnarmstrong/yang-mills-informalization/blob/main/manuscript/HumanizeYM_v2/HumanizeYM_v2.pdf>

    <item><hlink|LaTeX entry point|https://github.com/scottnarmstrong/yang-mills-informalization/blob/main/manuscript/HumanizeYM_v2/main.tex>

    <item><hlink|Source attribution and licenses|ATTRIBUTION.tm>
  </itemize-minus>

  Build from this directory with a LaTeX distribution, BibTeX and TikZ.

  <\verbatim-code>
    latexmk -pdf -jobname=HumanizeYM_v2 -halt-on-error main.tex
  </verbatim-code>

  <verbatim|source-sha256.json> records all 31 TeX inputs and the
  bibliography. The checked PDF has SHA-256
  <verbatim|8695468ab2164a365597b8b5628d5f6ea5da3c27760347b5844c99d56d02b4e0>.
</body>

